<title>FINLAND: Viking Nov-Aug passengers up 3.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Viking Nov-Aug passengers up 3.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish passenger ferry operator Viking Line AB said in a statement on Monday the number of passengers it transported in November-August rose 3.8 percent year-on-year to over 3.9 million.</p>
<p>&quot;During the period from November 1, 1995 to August 31, 1996, the number of passengers rose to over 3.9 million, an increase of 3.8 percent compared to the year-ago period,&quot; Viking Line said.  </p>
<p>Viking Line gave the following statistics (number of passengers):</p>
<p>			   95-Aug 96   Nov 94-Aug 95  Change</p>
<p>(pct)South-West Finland-Aland-Sweden 1,914,271 1,945,057 - 1.6</p>
<p>Helsinki-Stockholm 932,875 889,874 + 4.8Helsinki-Tallinn</p>
<p>1,080,562 949,785 + 13.8 Total 3,927,708 3,784,716 + 3.8 --</p>
<p>Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0248</p>
